this intro highlights many unique design decisions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:17.200
within sekiro firstly it took six games what we&nbsp;
now finally have a named and voice protagonist&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:22.240
sekiro still retains that soul's formula of giving&nbsp;
the player a title like Ashen One or Hunter as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:26.480
in this game were referred to as the shinobi of&nbsp;
the divine heir but most characters will still call&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:30.560
him wolf furthermore it's evident right from the&nbsp;
beginning that this game has a very unique style&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:35.120
to its storytelling sekiro is a very cutscene&nbsp;
and dialogue-driven game sekiro has a lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:39.440
cutscenes and conversations especially in the very&nbsp;
beginning and many of the game's objectives can be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:44.240
completed without talking to npcs as opposed&nbsp;
to other games where npcs were just optional&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:48.960
the story is also quite linear and this ties into&nbsp;
