00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:51.760
many of the local lords to vie for power and&nbsp;
attempt to dismantle all the other lords and even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:56.480
overtake the shogunate the main purpose was to&nbsp;
eventually unify all of japan under one rule and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:01.040
after the final battle called the siege of osaka&nbsp;
japan was eventually unified under the rule of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:07.200
tokugawa iyasu relating this back to sekura that's&nbsp;
why the first line in the game japan was consumed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:12.240
by a perpetual conflict makes sense as that&nbsp;
matches with the current time period the sengoku&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:16.960
era more transpires then it also brings context to&nbsp;
