00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:35.040
is integral to the main plot which is immortality&nbsp;
but we'll circle back to that later as the other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:39.920
reason was Isshin Ashina is already incredibly&nbsp;
